liba53
------------------------------------------
A5/3 Call Encryption Library

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  liba53-devel-4.0.0-1bl3
  liba53_1-4.0.0-1bl3
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/RangeNetworks/liba53

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/RangeNetworks/liba53/archive/v4.0.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack liba53-4.0.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./liba53-4.0.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/liba53-4.0.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/liba53-4.0.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/liba53_1-4.0.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/liba53-devel-4.0.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(liba53)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/liba53.README
  /usr/share/doc/liba53/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/liba53/README

(liba53_1)
  /usr/bin/cyga53-1.dll

(liba53-devel)
  /usr/include/a53.h
  /usr/lib/liba53.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/liba53.pc

------------------

